Source: tapitocam
Section: video
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Anonymous <root@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: tapitocam
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3,
         python3-pyside6.qtcore,
         python3-pyside6.qtgui,
         python3-pyside6.qtwidgets,
         mpv,
         python3-mpv
Description: TP-Link Tapo Camera RTSP Viewer & PTZ Controller
 Stream and control TP-Link Tapo IP cameras over RTSP.
 .
 Provides both a CLI client (tapitocam) using mpv and a
 GUI application (tapitocam-gui) built with PySide6.
 .
 PTZ control (pan/tilt) is supported via ONVIF.
 Note: the onvif-zeep Python package must be installed
 separately via pip for PTZ functionality.
